<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Olive oil, the Spirit,</l><l>Anoints us all our days.</l><l>Myrrh the fragrant death of Christ</l><l>Negative secretions slays!</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Cinnamon is for Christ’s death,</l><l>So effective and sweet.</l><l>Calamus—Christ’s resurrection</l><l>Nothing can defeat!</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Cassia—resurrection,</l><l>Repelling insects and snakes.</l><l>All of these ingredients</l><l>Are now for us to take!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
